    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nGround floor two bedroom apartment with rear patio and garden in this prestigious Rosslare Strand well managed gated estate.No. 38 is a spacious apartment situated just off the Strand Road and within a short stroll of all the amenities on offer including Kelly's Resort Hotel, The French Connection clothes shop, the famous Rosslare Strand Golf Links and the famous Blue Flag beach.Accommodation includes a large open plan living-dining area, separate kitchen, bathroom and two bedrooms (master ensuite). The entrance is shared with just one other apartment.The real bonus here is the rear patio area which opens up onto a garden which comes with the bonus of an access gate which is perfect for BBQ's and sitting out relaxing.Recent purchasers include owner occupiers and those looking for a holiday retreat in one of Ireland's premier destinations."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.5m x 1.14m\nWith tiled flooring.\n\nHall - 5.26m x 1.03m\nWith tiled flooring.\n\nLiving Area - 6.7m x 5m\nBright and spacious with double doors to rear patio and garden. Plenty of space for seperate dining and living areas. Comes with the benefit of an open fireplace, downlights and access into the kitchen.\n\nSeperate Kitchen - 2.55m x 2.55m\nWith tiled flooring and splashbacks, waist and eye level storage and plumbed for a washing machine.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.54m x 2.58m\n\n\nBedroom 2 Ensuite - 3.55m x 2.58m\nWith Bay Window.\n\nEnsuite - 1.75m x 1.54m\nFully tiled with Triton T90 Electric Shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBathroom - 2.92m x 2.28m\nWith tiled flooring and part tiled walls, bath, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nHot Press - \n\n\n"
      },
      {
